    "rth_phys_sum": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "K/s",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "description": "Sum of the physics potential-temperature tendencies of the step, rthraten + dtheta/dt|PBL (WRF's RTHRATEN + RTHBLTEN with cu = shcu = fdda = 0). The PBL part is the instantaneous derivative, WRF's is the implicit step's increment (see the test description)."
