     "units": "K/s",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "description": "The physics tendency of the MOIST potential temperature: what WRF's conv_t_tendf_to_moist makes of rth_phys_sum and rqvblten before the dynamics adds them to theta_m. This is the quantity the EqWeather-SCM state document adds to its D(theta_m) equation -- the physics suite's own output is a DRY theta tendency and cannot be used directly."
    },
